      ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort,
      ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort,
      ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null]]"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"defaultValues":{"tauntChance":{"$content":0.25,"$type":"System.Single"},"secondsBetweenTaunts":{"$content":6.0,"$type":"System.Single"},"tauntAction":{"$content":20,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"}},"LastExecutionStatus":"None","runtimeException":null,"positionRect":{"xMin":2912.0,"yMin":588.0,"xMax":3062.0,"yMax":688.0},"guid":"4e5b3fbd-4132-4ed9-b5e7-e722aca49855","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.RunBehaviorTreeGraphNode","$id":"84"},"Position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":0.0,"yMax":0.0},"transitionIndex":5,"guid":"7d4655f4-2399-4deb-8c8f-8c57df35b592","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.BehaviorTreeTransition"},{"position":{"xMin":-640.0,"yMin":-40.0,"xMax":-180.0,"yMax":160.0},"title":"Thug","body":"Every
      reaction sits above the ring and Idle under a reactive guard that takes over
      lower priority, so a hit interrupts whatever runs the same frame its fact changes.
      EnemyStatus publishes the two facts the reaction guards read: isAlive, and
      reaction, which the IsReacting Function compares with the kind passed at each
      call site. A different reaction replaces the one playing, heavier or lighter;
      the same one again changes nothing.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e0d29e3b-eadc-4105-aa38-e1a6920486d6","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1512.0,"yMin":328.0,"xMax":2032.0,"yMax":498.0},"title":"The
      ring","body":"In combat range a thug prowls around the place the encounter
      director gave it: one slow move, a short rest, and the root looks at its branches
      again. Farther out it walks to its target. Both guards are reactive and wake
      only when their facts change, so the prowl takes over from the approach on
      the frame the target comes into range, and a reaction above takes over either.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"bb8956ef-df42-4268-b611-a2927cddb466","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1512.0,"yMin":168.0,"xMax":1812.0,"yMax":318.0},"title":"Attack
      is entered, never taken over","body":"Its guard only checks at the door, on
      purpose. A thug in combat range asks for the turn every time the tree comes
      round, and all the while it prowls. Prowl ends the moment the turn is granted,
      and the tree comes round to Attack holding the token. Once it swings it is
      committed: only the reactions above it can cut it short.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"22492e37-4c3e-4295-b4ea-01012cfc9b8b","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-160.0,"yMin":-40.0,"xMax":200.0,"yMax":110.0},"title":"Committed
      knockdown","body":"KnockedDown runs with Stops Its Own Branch off: once down,
      the thug gets up before anything lighter is heard, and that hit is swallowed
      when the branch clears the fact. Stagger and Flinch keep it on, so any other
      reaction cuts them short.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"724ed10d-51d6-49f4-894e-7df6502fd988","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2212.0,"yMin":1008.0,"xMax":2512.0,"yMax":1158.0},"title":"Who
      sets the walking speed","body":"A branch that walks sets the speed it walks
      at as it starts: Prowl its own prowlSpeed, Approach and Attack the archetype''s
      moveSpeed, read here from the agent. So nothing has to put a speed back when
      a branch is cut short.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"2fee71fc-bf0c-48aa-8591-b83e5377ec74","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2762.0,"yMin":-172.0,"xMax":3062.0,"yMax":-22.0},"title":"Taunt
      is entered, never taken over","body":"Between two prowls the root comes round
      here. In combat range the branch rolls for a taunt, at most once every secondsBetweenTaunts,
      with the archetype''s tauntChance. Its guard checks only at the door, like
      Attack''s: a taunt that started plays to its end unless a reaction above cuts
      it short.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"6f8e2c7e-7614-4009-ac88-57a816a25222","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"ScriptGraphVariable":{"returnType":"System.Object,
      mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=b77a5c561934e089","function":21,"$id":"98"},"parameters":[],"resultType":"System.Object","scriptGraphVariables":[{"$ref":"98"}],"comment":"isAlive","relations":{"$content":[],"$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ConnectionCollection`3[[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPortRelation,
      ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null],[ArcaneOnyx.BehaviorTree.IPort,
